            "beta 18 - EME budget: bandwidth up to 3000 Hz, noise figures next to the gains, transverter left out of the calculation with gain 0, antenna temperature Tant (VE7BQH tables); general settings in the Tracking tab; blurred waxing Moon in the background of the main screen.",
            "Live position and +- 24h and general settings",
            "At the top you also find the general settings: amateur radio callsign, language, light or dark colour scheme, font size. In the background, a blurred image of the waxing Moon.",
            "Credits with links and version history.",
            "• Antenna performance: consult the VE7BQH tables (gain, G/T and antenna temperature Ta of the most common EME antennas) and enter the Tant value of your antenna in the EME budget. The antenna noise in those tables is computed with the antenna tilted at 30° elevation.",
