                "[10] HA1YA (Mechanics & Electronics), “ME2T-PRO-II & ME2HT-PRO-II 144MHz Transverter”, 25.09.2023, надано IC8TEM – http://www.ha1ya.hu/pdf/me2tpro2transverter.pdf",
